  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "While Toshi recruits friendly neighborhood helpers who share homemade side dishes as they package Kawada's reissue tapes, angry unpaid vendors storm Muranishi's studio demanding millions.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "連れてきたぞ。やっぱ人がいると違えな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "器用だね、やっぱり。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おっさんどうよ？いい感じだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ああ、うまそう。表にかかってください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ちょっと待って。これはいいや。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ああ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "すいません！僕らもホントに連絡が取れなくて困ってるんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "こっちは四百万以上も未納のままにされてんだぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "従業員の生活かかってるんだよ、こっちも！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "落ち着いて！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "みんな仲間じゃねえかよ、これでいいのか？みんな困ってるんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "ホントに連絡つかなくて、自分らも困ってるんです！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "連れてきたぞ。やっぱ人がいると違えな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I brought helpers along! Having extra people really makes a difference.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "器用だね、やっぱり。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You really are nimble with your hands.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おっさんどうよ？いい感じだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How's it going, pops? Looking real good!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ああ、うまそう。表にかかってください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, that homemade food looks delicious. Please start wrapping the covers carefully.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ちょっと待って。これはいいや。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hold on a second—leave this tape out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ああ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Got it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "すいません！僕らもホントに連絡が取れなくて困ってるんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm so sorry! We truly can't reach him either and don't know what to do!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "こっちは四百万以上も未納のままにされてんだぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He's left over four million yen unpaid on our invoices!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "従業員の生活かかってるんだよ、こっちも！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our own employees.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "落ち着いて！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please calm down!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "みんな仲間じゃねえかよ、これでいいのか？みんな困ってるんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Aren't we all comrades in this business? Is this okay with you?! Everyone is hurting!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "ホントに連絡つかなくて、自分らも困ってるんです！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We honestly cannot get hold of him—we're in trouble ourselves!'",
      "gap": 0.65
